Section: A2.1.10 Other costs
Up to CHF 500, such as:
a) Cost of necessary telephone calls in connection with the unroadworthy state of your vehicle or an insured event;
b) The costs incurred due to the loss of vehicle registration docu- ments and vehicle documents;
c) Garaging costs (storage charges).

